items.summary:
💀 Update from Mediazona:
At least 20 Russian officers were killed in a missile strike on the headquarters of the 41st Army in Donetsk on August 26.
5 majors;
7 colonels;
6 lieutenant colonels;
1 captain;
1 senior lieutenant.

